sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Frontend Host
    participant Backend as Backend Host<br/>Flask
    participant Database as Database Host<br/>PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM Host<br/>Ollama :11434
    
    Note over User,Database: Initial Authentication
    User->>Frontend: Enter credentials
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/login<br/>(username, password)
    Backend->>Database: authenticate_user(username, password)
    Database-->>Backend: User record (if valid)
    Backend->>Backend: Generate JWT token<br/>(user_id, username, role)<br/>exp: 24 hours
    Backend->>Database: update_last_login(user_id)
    Database-->>Backend: Success
    Backend-->>Frontend: JWT + user info<br/>(username, role, user_id)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store JWT in localStorage
    
    Note over User,LLM: Authenticated Query Request Flow
    User->>Frontend: Submit natural language query
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/query<br/>Authorization: Bearer {JWT}
    Backend->>Backend: @token_required decorator:<br/>1. Extract & decode JWT<br/>2. Verify signature (HS256)
    Backend->>Database: get_user_by_id(user_id)
    Database-->>Backend: User object → g.current_user
    Backend->>Database: get_schema_info()
    Database-->>Backend: Schema context
    Backend->>LLM: generate_sql(question, schema, role)
    LLM-->>Backend: Generated SQL query
    Backend->>Database: execute_query(sql)
    Database-->>Backend: Query results
    Backend->>Database: log_audit(user_id, query, status)
    Database-->>Backend: Audit logged
    Backend-->>Frontend: JSON response<br/>(sql, data, metrics)
    Frontend-->>User: Display results
    
    Note over Backend,Frontend: JWT expires after 24 hours<br/>Frontend redirects to /api/login